{
  "id": "npc_xiaohanye",
  "title": "萧寒夜对话",
  "description": "万魔宗弟子萧寒夜的日常对话",
  "start_node": "greeting",
  "metadata": {
    "npc_id": "xiaohanye",
    "npc_name": "萧寒夜",
    "location": "万魔宗"
  },
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "greeting",
      "speaker": "xiaohanye",
      "text": "又见面了。你这正道修士，倒是不怕和我这魔道中人打交道。",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "choice_ask_past",
          "text": "你为何加入万魔宗？",
          "next_node": "past_story"
        },
        {
          "id": "choice_spar",
          "text": "切磋一下如何？",
          "next_node": "spar_talk",
          "conditions": [
            {
              "type": "relationship",
              "target": "xiaohanye",
              "value": 15,
              "operator": ">="
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "choice_ask_news",
          "text": "万魔宗最近有什么动静？",
          "next_node": "news"
        },
        {
          "id": "choice_leave",
          "text": "告辞",
          "next_node": "END"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "past_story",
      "speaker": "xiaohanye",
      "text": "...我曾是正道宗门弟子。后来发现所谓正道不过是虚伪的遮羞布，便转投了万魔宗。至少在这里，没有人假装善良。",
      "emotion": "sad",
      "effects": [
        {
          "type": "relationship_change",
          "target": "xiaohanye",
          "value": 3,
          "reason": "倾听过往"
        }
      ],
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "choice_sympathize",
          "text": "每个人都有自己的苦衷",
          "next_node": "sympathize_response",
          "dao_heart_hint": -2
        },
        {
          "id": "choice_disagree",
          "text": "正道虽有瑕疵，但大义不可否认",
          "next_node": "disagree_response",
          "dao_heart_hint": 5
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "sympathize_response",
      "speaker": "xiaohanye",
      "text": "...你是我见过的第一个不急着说教的正道修士。也许你和那些人不一样。",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "effects": [
        {
          "type": "relationship_change",
          "target": "xiaohanye",
          "value": 8,
          "reason": "不带偏见"
        },
        {
          "type": "dao_heart_change",
          "value": -2,
          "reason": "同情魔道"
        }
      ],
      "next_node": "END"
    },
    {
      "id": "disagree_response",
      "speaker": "xiaohanye",
      "text": "哼，大义？你没见过那些长老们在暗处做的事。不过...你若真信这些，我倒也不会阻拦。",
      "emotion": "angry",
      "effects": [
        {
          "type": "relationship_change",
          "target": "xiaohanye",
          "value": -2,
          "reason": "立场不合"
        },
        {
          "type": "dao_heart_change",
          "value": 5,
          "reason": "坚持正道信念"
        }
      ],
      "next_node": "END"
    },
    {
      "id": "spar_talk",
      "speaker": "xiaohanye",
      "text": "切磋？有意思。万魔宗的'灭世七杀'可不是闹着玩的。不过今日就不动手了，改日我在荒原等你。",
      "emotion": "confident",
      "effects": [
        {
          "type": "relationship_change",
          "target": "xiaohanye",
          "value": 5,
          "reason": "以武会友"
        }
      ],
      "next_node": "END"
    },
    {
      "id": "news",
      "speaker": "xiaohanye",
      "text": "万魔宗内部也不太平。教主近日闭关修炼禁术，几个长老蠢蠢欲动...我劝你离万魔宗的事远一点。",
      "emotion": "serious",
      "effects": [
        {
          "type": "relationship_change",
          "target": "xiaohanye",
          "value": 2,
          "reason": "善意提醒"
        }
      ],
      "next_node": "END"
    }
  ]
}
